      "metadata": {
        "id": "b8dc1f27"
      },
      "source": [
        "* Minimum and Maximum\n",
        "\n",
        "The min() and max() functions return the smallest and largest elements in a list (only works if the list has comparable types, like all numbers)."
      ]
    },
